# Generated once by nise; owned by this application. Nise will not overwrite it.
#
# The Dockerfile's `COPY . .` would otherwise pull the whole working tree
# into the build stage, including a local node_modules of the wrong platform
# and a local frontend build that the multi-stage build is about to replace.

# Frontend tooling. The image's own frontend stage installs from
# frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml; a host node_modules is the wrong architecture
# more often than not, and copying it in is slow as well as wrong.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.svelte-kit/

# The frontend build output. The image's frontend stage produces it and
# copies it in explicitly, so a stale local build must not leak into the
# binary. The committed placeholder beside it is deliberately NOT ignored:
# it is what makes the Go build work before the frontend stage lands.
internal/platform/webui/embedded/client/

# Local build artifacts and version control.
bin/
.git/
.github/
*.out
*.test

# Secrets and local environment. .env.example is placeholders only and is
# kept so the image build can be inspected against it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editors and operating systems.
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
